lesson: 101
title: One equal part of a set
stars: 0
explain: A fraction like one third means: split the whole set into equal parts and take one part.
explain: To find one third of 12 apples, share them into 3 equal groups: 12 ÷ 3 = 4, so one third of 12 is 4.
explain: One fourth (a quarter) of 20 is 20 ÷ 4 = 5, and one fifth of 20 is 20 ÷ 5 = 4.
vars: a=name t=thing p=3..6 n=6..60
need: n % p == 0
need: n / p >= 2
answer: n / p
